        rdfs:label "Pietak & Levin (2017) electrodiffusive Nernst-Planck gap-junction morphogen transport & cryptic two-headed memory — Reproducibility package: 91/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Deterministic RNG (`seed=2017`), standalone 8-check `--self-test` suite verifying SHA-256 dataset locks, Boltzmann Nernst-Planck equilibrium identities, all 6 Pietak & Levin (2017) regeneration regimes (`1H1T` WT, `2H0T` octanol, `2H0T` cryptic washout memory, `0H2T` SCH-28080/forskolin, `2H0T` z=0 control, `1H1T` bioelectric K+ rescue), specimen bilateral ocelli segmentation, and bitwise two-run determinism (`atol=0.0`), plus rendered 9-panel PNG and 24-frame GIF in `docs/media/`." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
